n 5 bullet points: [paste text].<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Expand this blog section: \u201c[insert section]\u201d to make it more detailed.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Write a blog conclusion that includes a CTA to subscribe.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Turn this blog idea \u201c[idea]\u201d into a full content brief.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Give me an SEO-optimized blog on [topic] with headings and subheadings.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Write a how-to guide on [topic] with step-by-step instructions.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Social Media Content Prompts<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Create engaging posts for Instagram, Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, or Facebook using these prompts:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"11\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Write 5 engaging LinkedIn posts about [industry trend or topic].<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Generate a week\u2019s worth of Instagram captions for a [business type].<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Turn this blog into a carousel post for Instagram: \u201c[blog topic]\u201d<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Write 10 viral tweet ideas on [topic] with a witty tone.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create a short motivational caption for a fitness post.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Generate a poll idea for Twitter related to [topic].<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Make a CTA-driven Facebook post about a product launch.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Turn this case study into a LinkedIn story: [paste content]<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Suggest 5 hooks for a viral reel about [topic].<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Write a social media content calendar for 7 days on [theme].<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGL